{"id":"81181b26f16ba65a","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-dependent-choice.md","title":"Dependent Choice","display":"thm-dependent-choice — Dependent Choice","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-dependent-choice","aliases":["58-thm-dependent-choice","Dependent Choice","DC"],"display":"thm-dependent-choice — Dependent Choice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-ac]]","[[58-df-relation]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-dependent-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-dependent-choice</span><span>Dependent Choice</span><span>DC</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-choice — Dependent Choice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac\">58-ax-ac</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R\\in V\">\\(X,R\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the set-coded function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li>the ambient theory contains the axiom of choice <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac\">58-ax-ac</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}choice} \\vdash\n\\bigl(X \\neq \\varnothing \\land R \\subseteq X \\times X \\land \\forall x \\in X\\;\\exists y \\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,X)\\land f(0)=x_0\\land\\forall n \\in \\omega\\;(\\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}choice} \\vdash\n\\bigl(X \\neq \\varnothing \\land R \\subseteq X \\times X \\land \\forall x \\in X\\;\\exists y \\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,X)\\land f(0)=x_0\\land\\forall n \\in \\omega\\;(\\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the usual pointed formulation of <code>DC</code>: a chain is produced from every prescribed initial element, not merely from some unspecified point.</li>\n<li><code>AC \\Rightarrow DC</code>, while <code>DC</code> is strictly weaker than full choice in standard independence results.</li>\n<li><code>DC</code> is often enough for countable recursive constructions in analysis and topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-ac","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-ac]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,R\\in V$ and $R\\subseteq X\\times X$ (see [[58-df-relation]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the set-coded function predicate (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-ac","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"the ambient theory contains the axiom of choice [[58-ax-ac]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}choice} \\vdash\n\\bigl(X \\neq \\varnothing \\land R \\subseteq X \\times X \\land \\forall x \\in X\\;\\exists y \\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,X)\\land f(0)=x_0\\land\\forall n \\in \\omega\\;(\\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1331,"backlinks":[{"id":"57ef15d90618ea60","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-dependent-choice.md|58-thm-dependent-choice]]（batch19）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection.md]]\n[[58-thm-coanalytic-separation.md]]\n[[58-thm-coding-universe.md]]\n[[58-thm-cofinality-regular.md]]\n[[58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm-collapse-forcing.md]]\n[[58-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[58-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[58-thm-countable-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-covering-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-dense-set-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-dependent-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-determinacy.md]]\n[[58-thm-diamond-implies-CH.md]]\